# ============================================================================
# TinySMS Web: your TinySMS phone's texts, in a browser.
#
#   Conversations on the left, the one you're in on the right, and a box to
#   write in. The texts themselves go out from your TinySMS phone (the
#   gateway): this page asks tiny-web.uk to send them, and shows what came
#   back. Sign in with your tiny-web account; this browser keeps a key of its
#   own, never your password.
#
#   What it uses, all through Vml(...):
#     Fetch                    tiny-web.uk/api/console.php, as JSON
#     GetSetting, SetSetting   the key, kept by this browser
#
#   Made with Visualised: export it as a web page (vml html) and put it
#   anywhere. The scripts are at the bottom; "Start" runs first.
# ============================================================================

@Window TinySMSWeb
Title=TinySMS Web
Version=2.1
Width=1000
Height=640
OnOpened=Start

@Canvas c
Parent=TinySMSWeb
Width=1000
Height=640
Background=#D1D7DB

# --- signing in: a card in the middle of the page ---------------------------

